        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the mist-shrouded lands of the ancient wilderness, day and night move in their own relentless rhythm.<br>Daylight is calm and gentle, like ink flowing across rice paper — everything can be gathered, stacked, crafted, and shaped into the beginnings of a settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when night descends like a blade, the beast tide rises from the shadows.<br>The world turns from quiet resource management into raw survival, where positioning, construction, and timing decide whether your tribe endures the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Dawn: Nightfall</strong> is a survival strategy game built on stack-based building, light automation, and night-time wave defense.<br>During the day, you organize resources, expand production, discover new combinations, and strengthen the foundations of your tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/abc2714b9ea3aaf442ebbc4f152a413b.poster.avif?t=1766555043\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/abc2714b9ea3aaf442ebbc4f152a413b.webm?t=1766555043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/abc2714b9ea3aaf442ebbc4f152a413b.mp4?t=1766555043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When twilight fades, tranquility collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must send your people to confront the beasts, and defend the last flicker of firelight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/4ed50829e98c667e7913fe96339e0742.poster.avif?t=1766555043\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/4ed50829e98c667e7913fe96339e0742.webm?t=1766555043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/4ed50829e98c667e7913fe96339e0742.mp4?t=1766555043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stack and craft is a small step toward civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night endured is one more breath wrestled back from fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In this game you will experience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• A day-and-night survival loop: </strong>develop production and discover combinations by day; withstand waves of beasts and survive by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Strategy meets randomness: </strong>each run features different resources, events, and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Multi-layered progression: </strong>characters, buildings, equipment, and elixirs all contribute to your growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Ink-wash inspired world: </strong>an ancient land shaped by brushstrokes and mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When dawn touches the peaks once more, you may come to realize—</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>survival itself is a form of cultivation.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the mist-shrouded lands of the ancient wilderness, day and night move in their own relentless rhythm.<br>Daylight is calm and gentle, like ink flowing across rice paper — everything can be gathered, stacked, crafted, and shaped into the beginnings of a settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when night descends like a blade, the beast tide rises from the shadows.<br>The world turns from quiet resource management into raw survival, where positioning, construction, and timing decide whether your tribe endures the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Dawn: Nightfall</strong> is a survival strategy game built on stack-based building, light automation, and night-time wave defense.<br>During the day, you organize resources, expand production, discover new combinations, and strengthen the foundations of your tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/abc2714b9ea3aaf442ebbc4f152a413b.poster.avif?t=1766555043\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/abc2714b9ea3aaf442ebbc4f152a413b.webm?t=1766555043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/abc2714b9ea3aaf442ebbc4f152a413b.mp4?t=1766555043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When twilight fades, tranquility collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must send your people to confront the beasts, and defend the last flicker of firelight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/4ed50829e98c667e7913fe96339e0742.poster.avif?t=1766555043\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/4ed50829e98c667e7913fe96339e0742.webm?t=1766555043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181030/extras/4ed50829e98c667e7913fe96339e0742.mp4?t=1766555043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stack and craft is a small step toward civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night endured is one more breath wrestled back from fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In this game you will experience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• A day-and-night survival loop: </strong>develop production and discover combinations by day; withstand waves of beasts and survive by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Strategy meets randomness: </strong>each run features different resources, events, and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Multi-layered progression: </strong>characters, buildings, equipment, and elixirs all contribute to your growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Ink-wash inspired world: </strong>an ancient land shaped by brushstrokes and mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When dawn touches the peaks once more, you may come to realize—</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>survival itself is a form of cultivation.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "A day-and-night survival and base-building game featuring stack-based crafting, resource management, and night-time wave defense. Build your settlement by day, defend the firelight by night, and grow your tribe through an ever-shifting cycle of threat and discovery.",
